		"description": {
			"public": "<p><strong>Weapon Kit</strong> &middot; <em>Engineer invention. Counts as a weapon for swapping and stowing. Toolbelt options cost 2 Actions and 1 Toolbelt scrap.</em></p><hr><p><strong>Cryo Grenade (basic) &mdash; 1 Action.</strong> Range 6, 2d6 Cold. Targets adjacent to the space take half damage.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt (2 Actions, 1 scrap):</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Flame Grenade.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3, 2d6 Fire. On hit: applies Smoldering. Can still crit or miss. The area burns for 1 round; targets take INT Fire damage for each space they enter on a turn. This ignores armor.</li><li><strong>Smoke Grenade.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3. The area fills with thick smoke for 1 minute or until dispersed. Smoke obstructs view and can't be seen through.</li><li><strong>Concussion Grenade.</strong> Range 6, Blast 2. On a failed STR save, targets are Blinded, Dazed, and Slowed, 1 turn. On a save, they are only Dazed.</li></ul><p><strong>High Levels:</strong> +5 damage every 5 levels (Cryo Grenade &amp; Flame Grenade).</p>",
